id: pm-gh1694
title: "GH-1694: recover pinned Bun and verified uploader downloads after GitHub asset gateway failures"
description: "Release42560970081 published npm2026.11.9 but macOS Bun acceptance repeatedly fails before execution because the official Bun1.4.0 darwin-aarch64 asset URL returns HTTP504. The same exact URL with download=1 returns bytes matching the GitHub-published SHA256. Dependabot PR1691 likewise passed full exact coverage and failed only the pinned Codecov CLI asset download. Preserve versions, immutable release identity, no-cache policy, uploader checksum and required checks while making these external-download boundaries recoverable."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: ci,"gh:1694",release,transport
created_at: "2026-11-09T07:50:38.300Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T03:42:18.115Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-10T03:42:17.220Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-10T03:42:17.220Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "macOS registry acceptance installs the same pinned Bun release through an official verified transport; Required Codecov uploads retain fail-closed checksum verification before execution; Focused workflow tests and hosted exact-head checks pass without ignoring mandatory failures; Exact-tag recovery keeps the existing tag and npm identity, with the live publication acceptance outcome tracked by pm-7zs0"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Recover official pinned Bun and immutable verified Codecov downloads while preserving versions, checksums and step-scoped credentials. Require uncached native macOS/Windows Bun bootstrap and exact-version admission before npm publication, governed by registry policy and a version-mismatch negative control. Admit first-publication recovery after an explicit completed+skipped empty publisher job, retaining complete inventory/attempt validation and every prior accepted-publication refusal."
expected_result: "Bootstrap failures prevent publication and remain recoverable against the same immutable tag; no accepted earlier publication, incomplete inventory or malformed evidence can authorize another publish."
actual_result: "An isolated negative control reproduced exactly the skipped-publisher refusal:1failure/16passes. All67 current release assertions across6files and all4 linked owner commands pass, including accepted-attempt, contradictory-step, malformed-job, complete-pagination, native-version and checksum controls. Full typechecks, ESLint, direct static quality, contracts and zero-change SDK surface pass. Independently verified2026.11.9 release child42601586640 remains successful across12jobs with preserved tag/npm identity; this revised source awaits its own hosted100/100/100/100 admission and fresh reviews before delivery."
dependencies[2]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
