comments[14]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T07:50:38.300Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status corpus plus keyword AND searches for Bun setup asset release download and download gateway Codecov Bun found only the standing release reminder and unrelated broad quality owner. Reuse closed uploader-security lineage as discovered_from and the daily health reminder as related."
  "2026-11-09T07:52:12.327Z","harness:codex","Independent transport proof: official Bun1.4.0 macOS ARM64 bytes downloaded through download=1 match GitHub asset SHA256 c669e97f6164e1c96e0701748db98dfa77492908cbd8394c7557134a735de381. Official Codecov asset470877726 via GitHub release asset API matches the unchanged reviewed SHA256 ca1d64196d2d34771084afe76ea657d581bf628e31d993ff8e52ea09cc88a56d. Both ordinary URLs reproduced HTTP504. The new workflow transport assertions fail before mutation. Keep fail-closed corrupt-byte tests, no-cache Bun, mandatory uploads, and existing immutable release identity."
  "2026-11-09T08:00:02.476Z","harness:codex","Local regression acceptance: both new workflow transport assertions failed on the old workflow, while existing approved/corrupt-byte controls remained meaningful. Updated workflows plus close-guidance tests now pass80 tests. Reviewed exact-tag recovery will use the current main control scripts, preserve the existing npm identity and keep all nine registry acceptance rows mandatory. The live publication outcome remains recorded by the standing daily release-health owner pm-7zs0."
  "2026-11-09T08:08:46.571Z","harness:codex","Workflow authoring cross-check: GitHub Actions contexts reference confirms runner.os=macOS and runner.arch=ARM64 or X64 for the selected asset mapping. Primary reference: https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/contexts#runner-context . The action metadata at the pinned setup-bun commit explicitly supports bun-download-url; the override is confined to macOS registry acceptance and preserves the unchanged pinned version and no-cache=true."
  "2026-11-09T09:53:14.974Z","harness:codex","PR #1696 review remediation: the immutable Codecov asset API request uses the step-scoped GitHub credential while retaining the mandatory SHA256 gate and fail-closed uploads. The required packed macOS PR check now runs the exact pinned uncached Bun download override and verifies runtime version before merge/publication. This tests the selected transport directly; no dynamic fallback logic or extra paid runner has been introduced."
  "2026-11-09T11:52:05.525Z","harness:codex","Executed Bash verifier controls now capture actual curl argv and require both binary Accept and authenticated Authorization headers, independently of workflow comments. The prepublication contract asserts the complete official URL expression and exact pinned Bun version comparison. Approved and corrupt payload controls pass; head 8e67e43fa also passed the actual required macOS Bun setup/runtime check before this test-only strengthening."
  "2026-11-09T12:49:39.778Z","harness:codex","Exact-head delivery acceptance remains PENDING: the final pushed revision must pass every required hosted check, including static, full 100% coverage, native packed runtimes and Codecov, plus a fresh reviewer inventory. The earlier macOS success on 8e67e43 is limited prior-head evidence and does not accept subsequent revisions. Latest observed fac6cfe80 has CodeFactor/DeepScan/Greptile success but GitHub Actions foundation and security jobs are still queued after the bounded 20-minute watch. No merge or production recovery is authorized by those incomplete signals. The existing-tag reminder now explicitly retains v2026.11.9 recovery even after the UTC date changes."
  "2026-11-09T12:51:19.811Z","harness:codex","Native prepublication regression now asserts both the macOS-only guard and the exact pinned Bun equality command, alongside the full official architecture-aware asset URL. The focused workflow cohort passes. Final-head hosted acceptance and existing-tag publication remain pending; the standing reminder explicitly names the original tag independently of future daily cuts."
  "2026-11-09T15:28:11.501Z","harness:codex","Review negative control: the new release-dependency assertion fails before the change. Release now requires a native macOS/Windows Bun bootstrap matrix before Build/Test/Publish, using the same reviewed pin, uncached official transport and an exact version check. A platform download/version failure blocks the publisher instead of becoming only post-publication acceptance. Existing installed-package acceptance and immutable tag recovery remain separate. YAML contract checks and 279 focused tests pass; hosted source-head acceptance remains required."
  "2026-11-09T15:40:27.777Z","harness:codex","Final prepublication controls execute the actual version-check script with a mocked native executable result: pinned 1.4.0 with Windows CRLF succeeds and 1.4.1 fails with the expected diagnostic. Together with the required release needs edge, two native OS rows, exact approved action/asset inputs and fail-closed step flags, this prevents runtime-bootstrap failure from occurring only after npm publication. All 355 instrumented cohort tests pass; real hosted checks for the final revision remain pending."
  "2026-11-09T20:22:13.508Z","harness:codex","Publication recovery verified 2026-11-09T20:22:07.900467+00:00: preserved Release child 42601586640 completed SUCCESS with all 12 jobs green, including producer, publication verifier, all nine native macOS/Windows/Ubuntu npm/npm-global/Bun acceptance jobs, and GitHub advertisement. The full public verifier passes with GitHub verification enabled, npm and executor attempts set to one: npm metadata, npx/bunx named and package-default CLI paths, stdio/HTTP MCP, all four declared bins, and expected nonzero negative controls. npm latest and the sole daily npm identity remain 2026.11.9; GitHub advertises v2026.11.9 and its annotated tag object remains 4bcc6fe0e88051eded262aa183f07c6e63546515. No new identity or recovery child was created. This recovery does not erase original failure evidence or publish the new SDK changes from PR #1696 under the existing version. Final-head PR checks/review and the next eligible scheduled daily cut remain distinct. Latest required observability passes: production Sentry critical/high/active zero, telemetry error rate 4.94 percent, missing codes zero, queue flush 1 to 0. This is subsequent operational acceptance evidence; the original structured source-fix closure remains unchanged. Canonical recurring verification continues in pm-7zs0."
  "2026-11-09T22:39:15.779Z","harness:codex","CI remediation: Windows scripts cohort and hosted coverage shard 4 correctly rejected the unregistered release.yml prepublication-bun job. Added a governed gate with canonical owner, download/version failure taxonomy, no bypass, the existing executed mismatched-version negative control, and a truthful hosted-only declaration requiring clean native macOS/Windows runners. Gate registry validates 23 gates and 27 enforced pipelines; its committed-policy tests and the actual Bun version-check negative control pass. All 455 cohort tests and nine packed consumers pass. Earlier same-tag production release recovery remains verified independently; this prepublication prevention awaits reviewed delivery."
  "2026-11-10T03:37:57.304Z","harness:codex","Full review of effd14f8f identified a release-admission interaction: failed native Bun bootstrap makes GitHub mark Build/Test/Publish completed+skipped with no steps, while the first-publication guard currently requires a Publish to npm step. Reproduce against the real guard and admit only that explicit terminal empty-job shape, retaining complete pagination, exact tag/job/attempt identity, and any previously accepted publication across all other attempts. The independently completed2026.11.9 recovery remains verified and immutable. The repeated scope request is declined under the authorized combined PM cohort; the unverified config candidate-hoist nit is also declined because the bounded error-only allocation avoids adding work to every SDK import without measured benefit."
  "2026-11-10T03:42:16.539Z","harness:codex","Verified the exact GitHub jobs-list wire shape independently: a terminal skipped job has status=completed, conclusion=skipped and steps=[]. In an isolated tracked-source copy the new recovery case failed with Missing Release publication job evidence while16 existing cases passed. The guard now accepts only that explicit empty-job shape, still validates full pagination and canonical run/attempt identity, and continues inspecting every other attempt. Regression controls refuse accepted publication in either inventory order and even contradictory skipped-job metadata containing a successful publish step; missing/null/non-array steps and nonterminal or failed empty jobs remain refused. All67 release assertions across6 files and all4 linked owner entries pass. Full typechecks, ESLint, direct static quality, contracts and zero-change SDK surface pass; the revised head still requires complete hosted checks and fresh full reviews."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T10:03:51.702Z","harness:codex","When a pinned official asset route fails, keep the version and byte-integrity controls. Exercise the selected transport on its native platform before publication and keep recovery of an existing tag distinct from creating another daily release."
